<title>USA: U.S. mortgage refinancing volume up 4.3 pct.</title>
<headline>U.S. mortgage refinancing volume up 4.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The volume of U.S. mortgage refinancing applications rose 4.3 percent in the week ended August 8, according to a Mortgage Bankers Association of America weekly survey.</p>
<p>The total volume of mortgage applications gained 3.7 percent in the latest survey week, while applications to purchase mortgages rose 3.5 percent.</p>
<p>The seasonally adjusted refinancing index rose 4.3 percent to 718.8 from 689.3 the previous week. The purchase index rose 4.2 percent to 220.5 in the latest survey from 211.7 in the previous week.  </p>
